+/* Playport hostpad: the virtual pad's HID report descriptor and the preparsed data
+ * hidparse.sys (this tree's dlls/hidparse.sys/main.c, built for the host) makes from it.
+ * Generated; both are pointer-free and laid out alike on every 64-bit target. */
